<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Nayataran</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset dan gaya dasar */
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; color: #5C3A21; background-color: #FFF7F0; }
    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }/* Header */
header { background-color: #FDEEF4; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #F8C5D3; }
header .logo { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: bold; color: #D45D79; }
nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin-top: 10px; }
nav ul li { font-weight: 600; }

/* Hero */
.hero { padding: 60px 20px; text-align: center; background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/1200x400/FFE4E1/000000?text=Hantaran+Pernikahan'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: #5C3A21; }
.hero h1 { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.hero p { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 30px; }
.hero .btn { background-color: #D45D79; color: #FFF; padding: 12px 30px; border-radius: 25px; font-size: 1rem; }

/* Section umum */
section { padding: 60px 20px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
section h2 { font-size: 2rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #D45D79; }

/* Layanan */
.services { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center; }
.service-card { background-color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #F3D2DF; border-radius: 12px; width: 280px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
.service-card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.service-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }

/* Galeri */
.gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; }
.gallery img { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; }

/* Testimoni */
.testimonials { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
.testimonial-card { background-color: #FFF1F6; border-left: 4px solid #D45D79; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; }
.testimonial-card p { margin-bottom: 10px; font-style: italic; }
.testimonial-card span { display: block; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; }

/* Kontak */
.contact { background-color: #F8EDEB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; }
.contact form { display: grid; gap: 15px; }
.contact input, .contact textarea { padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #F3D2DF; border-radius: 6px; width: 100%; font-size: 1rem; }
.contact button { background-color: #D45D79; color: #FFF; padding: 12px; border: none; border-radius: 25px; font-size: 1rem; width: 150px; justify-self: center; }

/* Footer */
footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; background-color: #FDEEF4; margin-top: 40px; }

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">Nayataran</div>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#services">Layanan</a></li>
        <li><a href="#gallery">Galeri</a></li>
        <li><a href="#testimonials">Testimoni</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Kontak</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>Penyewaan Hantaran Berbagai Macam Model Yang Kekinian</h1>
    <p>Desain personal dan penuh makna untuk momen terindah Anda.</p>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Pesan Sekarang</a>
  </section>  <section id="services">
    <h2>Layanan Kami</h2>
    <div class="services">
      <div class="service-card">
        <h3>Hantaran Custom</h3>
        <p>Pilih tema, warna, dan isi hantaran sesuai keinginan Anda.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <h3>Paket Standard</h3>
        <p>Paket lengkap dengan elemen tradisional dan modern.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <h3>Paket Premium</h3>
        <p>Hantaran eksklusif dengan bahan berkualitas tinggi.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>  <section id="gallery">
    <h2>Galeri Hasil Kerja</h2>
    <div class="gallery">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300" alt="Hantaran 1">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300" alt="Hantaran 2">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300" alt="Hantaran 3">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x300" alt="Hantaran 4">
    </div>
  </section>  <section id="testimonials">
    <h2>Testimoni Pelanggan</h2>
    <div class="testimonials">
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <p>"Hantaran dari Naya sangat elegan dan sesuai harapan kami!"
        </p><span>— Rina</span>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <p>"Layanan cepat dan hasilnya cantik sekali. Terima kasih Naya Hantaran!"
        </p><span>— Putri</span>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <p>"Rekomendasi sekali untuk teman-teman yang mau menikah."
        </p><span>— Dewi</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2>Kontak Kami</h2>
    <form action="mailto:Nayantara99@gmail.com method="post" enctype="text/plain">
      <input type="text" name="Nama" placeholder="Inaya" required>
      <input type="email" name="Email" placeholder="Nayantara99@gmail.com" required>
      <textarea name="Pesan" rows="4" placeholder="Pesan atau pertanyaan Anda" required></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Kirim</button>
    </form>
  </section>  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 Nayataran. All Rights Reserved.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
